      "type": "text",
      "text": "Monitor continuously for early hypotension, apnea, airway obstruct and O2 desaturation, w airway, ventilation, O2 and resuscitation equipment STAT available; more likely after rapid boluses, esp. in elderly or debilitated pts."
     }
    ]
   },
